<section class="ways_section" id="ways"><div class="section-inner"><h2 class="section_h2">Ways to work with us</h2><ul class="ways_grid" role="list"><li class="ways_item"><h3 class="ways_h3">Integration partner</h3><p class="ways_body">Fixed scope, milestone-based, our team end to end. As with EURCV and LI.FI.</p><div class="ways_meta"><div class="ways_meta-label">First two weeks</div><div class="inline-text"> scoping session</div></div></li><li class="ways_item"><h3 class="ways_h3">Architecture lead with your engineers</h3><p class="ways_body">We design the system and lead delivery inside your engineering team. As with the settlement stablecoin of a top US commercial bank.</p><div class="ways_meta"><div class="ways_meta-label">First two weeks</div><div class="inline-text"> architecture note</div></div></li><li class="ways_item"><h3 class="ways_h3">Embedded principal engineer</h3><p class="ways_body">A principal engineer placed with your team for a quarter or more. As with the Stellar Development Foundation.</p><div class="ways_meta"><div class="ways_meta-label">First two weeks</div><div class="inline-text"> onboarding</div></div></li><li class="ways_item"><h3 class="ways_h3">Programs for ecosystems</h3><p class="ways_body">DevX audits, tooling roadmaps, accelerator and hackathon mentoring. As with Ripple.</p><div class="ways_meta"><div class="ways_meta-label">First two weeks</div><div class="inline-text"> audit kickoff</div></div></li></ul><figure class="ways_team"><img alt="The Aha Company engineering team" class="ways_team-img" height="1065" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 50vw" src="/images/photos/team-photo-office.webp" srcset="/images/photos/team-photo-office-960.webp 960w, /images/photos/team-photo-office.webp 1600w, /images/photos/team-photo-office-2400.webp 2400w" width="1600"/><figcaption class="ways_team-caption"><div>The team</div><div data-rv="ways-team-caption">United States · Europe · Brazil</div></figcaption></figure></div></section>
